---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title='Care & Service | OTA World'
  description='Delivery, installation, and warranty for Osaki, Titan, and AmaMedic stay with OTA World in Carrollton.'
>
<main id="main">
    <section class="chapter-hero">
      <img src="/assets/images/home-grid-1.jpg" alt="OTA World headquarters" />
      <div class="chapter-hero-veil"></div>
      <div class="container chapter-hero-copy">
        <div class="kicker">Care &amp; service</div>
        <h1>We guarantee the house<br />behind the chair.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Delivery and installation into the room. Warranty and repair through Carrollton — not left with a store that has moved on.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="glance">
      <article>
        <div class="num">01</div>
        <h3>Delivered</h3>
        <p>The chair is brought to the home. You do not carry the company on your back.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="num">02</div>
        <h3>Installed</h3>
        <p>Set in the room, ready to sit. The floor’s work continues at the door.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="num">03</div>
        <h3>Stood behind</h3>
        <p>If something needs service, call the house. Warranty lives with headquarters.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <div class="num">04</div>
        <h3>Kept</h3>
        <p>Built to be used for years — not set aside when the next catalog arrives.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container hq">
        <div class="hq-card">
          <div class="kicker" style="color:var(--gold-light)">Need help</div>
          <h2>Call the house first.</h2>
          <p>A person at headquarters is the shortest path — for a guest, a partner floor, or a chair already at home.</p>
          <p><a class="phone-xl" href="tel:+18888482630" style="margin:12px 0 0">888-848-2630</a></p>
          <p><a href="tel:+12143074771">214-307-4771</a></p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact?topic=service">Request service</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="kicker">After you sit</div>
            <h2>What happens next.</h2>
            <p class="intro">Once a chair is chosen, Carrollton stays on the work: the truck, the room, and the years after.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li><span class="num">1</span><span>Headquarters schedules delivery with you.</span></li>
            <li><span class="num">2</span><span>The chair is installed in the room — not left at the curb.</span></li>
            <li><span class="num">3</span><span>If service is needed, you call the same house that showed it.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
